sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Kafka as Kafka Event Bus
    participant PCM as Price Calculation Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant QM as Query Module
    participant CMP as Channel Mgmt Publisher
    participant CMS as Channel Mgmt System

    Note over User,CMS: === SIMULATION PHASE ===
    User->>SPA: Select hotel, dates, new base rate
    SPA->>GW: POST /api/prices/simulate
    Note over GW: AuthFilter validates JWT
    Note over GW: AuthorizationService checks hotel permission
    GW->>GW: Generate tracking ID
    GW->>Kafka: Publish to price-change-commands {action: simulate, trackingId}
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 202 Accepted + trackingId
    SPA-->>User: "Simulation submitted"

    Kafka->>PCM: Consume price-change-commands
    PCM->>PCM: PriceChangeCommandConsumer routes to simulate path
    PCM->>PCM: PriceSimulator invokes RateCalculationEngine
    PCM->>DB: Fetch current rates and business rules (read-only)
    PCM->>PCM: Calculate proposed prices for all rate/room/date combos
    PCM->>PCM: Cache simulation result in SimulationResultCache (TTL: 5 min)
    PCM->>PCM: Update status: simulation complete

    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices/simulate/{trackingId}/status
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 {status: "complete", data: proposedPrices}
    SPA-->>User: Display simulated prices

    Note over User,CMS: === APPLICATION PHASE (user confirms) ===
    User->>SPA: Confirm and apply price change
    SPA->>GW: POST /api/prices/apply {trackingId}
    Note over GW: AuthFilter validates JWT
    Note over GW: AuthorizationService checks hotel permission
    GW->>GW: Generate new tracking ID for apply
    GW->>Kafka: Publish to price-change-commands {action: apply, simulationTrackingId, applyTrackingId}
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 202 Accepted + applyTrackingId
    SPA-->>User: "Price change submitted"

    Kafka->>PCM: Consume price-change-commands
    PCM->>PCM: PriceChangeCommandConsumer routes to apply path
    PCM->>PCM: Retrieve simulation result from cache
    PCM->>PCM: PriceChangeValidator validates
    PCM->>PCM: PriceChangeApplier writes to write_model schema
    Note over PCM,DB: Same transaction
    PCM->>PCM: PriceEventPublisher publishes to price-change-events
    PCM->>PCM: Update status: applied

    Note over QM: Read model update
    Kafka->>QM: Consume price-change-events
    QM->>QM: ReadModelProjector refreshes materialized view
    QM->>QM: Prices now queryable from read model

    Note over CMP,CMS: Channel Management push
    Kafka->>CMP: Consume price-change-events
    CMP->>CMP: IdempotencyChecker verifies not duplicate
    CMP->>CMS: POST /api/channel/prices (REST)
    CMS-->>CMP: HTTP 200 OK
    CMP->>CMP: Mark event as processed

    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices/apply/{applyTrackingId}/status
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 {status: "complete"}
    SPA-->>User: "Price change complete and published"